281,333,334,344,354,364,374,384,394,404,414,428,438],{},[271,335,336,341],{},[286,337,338],{},[289,339,340],{},"200",[286,342,343],{},"OK - Request succeeded.",[271,345,346,351],{},[286,347,348],{},[289,349,350],{},"201",[286,352,353],{},"Created - Resource was successfully created.",[271,355,356,361],{},[286,357,358],{},[289,359,360],{},"204",[286,362,363],{},"No Content - Request succeeded with no response body (e.g., deletes).",[271,365,366,371],{},[286,367,368],{},[289,369,370],{},"400",[286,372,373],{},"Bad Request - The request was malformed.",[271,375,376,381],{},[286,377,378],{},[289,379,380],{},"401",[286,382,383],{},"Unauthorized - Invalid or missing API key.",[271,385,386,391],{},[286,387,388],{},[289,389,390],{},"403",[286,392,393],{},"Forbidden - The API key doesn't have permission for this action.",[271,395,396,401],{},[286,397,398],{},[289,399,400],{},"404",[286,402,403],{},"Not Found - The requested resource doesn't exist.",[271,405,406,411],{},[286,407,408],{},[289,409,410],{},"409",[286,412,413],{},"Conflict - Idempotency mismatch, request still in progress, outcome unknown, a concurrent write, or a refund of the same order already being created.",[271,415,416,421],{},[286,417,418],{},[289,419,420],{},"422",[286,422,423,424,427],{},"Unprocessable Entity - Validation failed. Check the ",[289,425,426],{},"errors"," field for details.",[271,429,430,435],{},[286,431,432],{},[289,433,434],{},"429",[286,436,437],{},"Too Many Requests - Rate limit exceeded. Slow down your requests.",[271,439,440,445],{},[286,441,442],{},[289,443,444],{},"500",[286,446,447],{},"Internal Server Error - Something went wrong on Vatly's end.",[254,449],{},[257,451,453],{"id":452},"error-responses","Error responses",[250,455,456],{},"Whenever a request is unsuccessful, the Vatly API will return an error response with a human-readable message. Combine it with the HTTP status code to understand what has gone wrong and how to fix it. Most of the error messages are pretty helpful a